  "verseCount": 36,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LEV 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Ordination of Aaron and His Sons",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.8.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.8.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said to Moses,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Bring Aaron and his sons, their garments, the anointing oil, the bull for the sin offering,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "the two rams and the basket containing bread made without yeast,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and gather the entire assembly at the entrance to the tent of meeting.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses did as the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.8.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.8.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "commanded him, and the assembly gathered at the entrance to the tent of meeting.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses said to the assembly, \"This is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.8.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.8.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "has commanded to be done.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Moses brought Aaron and his sons forward and washed them with water.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He put the tunic on Aaron, tied the sash around him, clothed him with the robe and put the ephod on him. He also fastened the ephod with a decorative waistband, which he tied around him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He placed the breastpiece on him and put the Urim and Thummim in the breastpiece.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he placed the turban on Aaron's head and set the gold plate, the sacred emblem, on the front of it, as the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.8.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.8.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "commanded Moses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Moses took the anointing oil and anointed the tabernacle and everything in it, and so consecrated them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He sprinkled some of the oil on the altar seven times, anointing the altar and all its utensils and the basin with its stand, to consecrate them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He poured some of the anointing oil on Aaron's head and anointed him to consecrate him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he brought Aaron's sons forward, put tunics on them, tied sashes around them and fastened caps on them, as the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.8.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.8.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "commanded Moses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He then presented the bull for the sin offering, and Aaron and his sons laid their hands on its head.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses slaughtered the bull and took some of the blood, and with his finger he put it on all the horns of the altar to purify the altar. He poured out the rest of the blood at the base of the altar. So he consecrated it to make atonement for it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses also took all the fat around the internal organs, the long lobe of the liver, and both kidneys and their fat, and burned it on the altar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the bull with its hide and its flesh and its intestines he burned up outside the camp, as the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.8.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.8.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "commanded Moses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He then presented the ram for the burnt offering, and Aaron and his sons laid their hands on its head.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Moses slaughtered the ram and splashed the blood against the sides of the altar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He cut the ram into pieces and burned the head, the pieces and the fat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He washed the internal organs and the legs with water and burned the whole ram on the altar. It was a burnt offering, a pleasing aroma, a food offering presented to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.8.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.8.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", as the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.8.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.8.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "commanded Moses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He then presented the other ram, the ram for the ordination, and Aaron and his sons laid their hands on its head.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses slaughtered the ram and took some of its blood and put it on the lobe of Aaron's right ear, on the thumb of his right hand and on the big toe of his right foot.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses also brought Aaron's sons forward and put some of the blood on the lobes of their right ears, on the thumbs of their right hands and on the big toes of their right feet. Then he splashed blood against the sides of the altar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After that, he took the fat, the fat tail, all the fat around the internal organs, the long lobe of the liver, both kidneys and their fat and the right thigh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And from the basket of bread made without yeast, which was before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.8.26",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.8.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", he took one thick loaf, one thick loaf with olive oil mixed in, and one thin loaf, and he put these on the fat portions and on the right thigh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He put all these in the hands of Aaron and his sons, and they waved them before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
